        "slc_50493ddd6d888782976809fc2aa5aed4e83da2be548b2edb47ebbcc0956b718a"
      ],
      "text": "Maestro is a cross-platform desktop application for running 1-6 Claude Code (or other AI CLI) sessions simultaneously, each in its own isolated git worktree."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_248bb5f6ad6f2a74156a21a49b5099cd4b92f7574cb5ecc673ba3d95375c1a5c",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a10500d099836e7e7185977c1cda6f263a53b55d",
          "git_sha": "011bc835936f7f3f816dc7a4a6f68fe09399af76",
          "line_end": 51,
          "line_start": 47,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "its-maestro-baby/maestro",
          "url": "https://github.com/its-maestro-baby/maestro/blob/a10500d099836e7e7185977c1cda6f263a53b55d/README.md#L47-L51"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_36fb8e2b4e21064b01b9ac5fd217fda0a14b55a1b7ee65c4295f66695c004bbd"
      ],
      "text": "Each session gets its own terminal with a full shell environment, a git worktree for code isolation, an assigned branch, and a port allocation for web development."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_805b92d6b1a65f991c5c74d2e381d6127d71790701899ae52df4459f4bfd9ea5",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a10500d099836e7e7185977c1cda6f263a53b55d",
          "git_sha": "011bc835936f7f3f816dc7a4a6f68fe09399af76",
          "line_end": 184,
          "line_start": 178,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "its-maestro-baby/maestro",
          "url": "https://github.com/its-maestro-baby/maestro/blob/a10500d099836e7e7185977c1cda6f263a53b55d/README.md#L178-L184"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_25104e6517ef8cb1830432b93dada768234bf86710dd4ed7d87ea4c0e3ab043e"
      ],
      "text": "The stack comprises a Tauri 2.0/Rust backend, a React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS frontend, xterm.js terminal emulation, a Rust MCP server, and native git CLI for git operations."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1c0849298b95eed49532e84affd5feeb55920f7de74fe9cb490446d0f1f5d214",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a10500d099836e7e7185977c1cda6f263a53b55d",
          "git_sha": "011bc835936f7f3f816dc7a4a6f68fe09399af76",
          "line_end": 70,
          "line_start": 67,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "its-maestro-baby/maestro",
          "url": "https://github.com/its-maestro-baby/maestro/blob/a10500d099836e7e7185977c1cda6f263a53b55d/README.md#L67-L70"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a3d52e956171c8b996d48d4ba08e66136ce11aabfc5fc33ce7c30d92e2fce7cf"
      ],
      "text": "The app offers a dynamic 1x1 to 2x3 session grid, iTerm2-style split panes, real-time status indicators, and per-session mode selection among Claude Code, Gemini CLI, OpenAI Codex, or plain terminal."
    },
    {
