        "slc_790846725df9dc33bad289c3ce462ac0d32dbcf442a27e4a52d57757b908ed24"
      ],
      "text": "A documented keyboard shortcut set covers session creation, pane splitting, terminal cycling, zoom, copy, and line navigation, with Cmd mapping to Ctrl on Windows/Linux."
    },
