        "slc_c101a08f5ae1cc1395af67781ed7e486c28a7fbdc4c840ecdaa173334c42b297"
      ],
      "text": "A Rust ProcessManager manages sessions whose worktrees live under ~/.claude-maestro/worktrees/{repo}/{branch}, connecting to the MCP server over stdio."
